<p><strong>2. Uncrating and Functional Testing</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Trained uncrating teams, equipped with safety gloves and anti‑static tools, open each package in the staging area under supervision.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Electrical items (servers, UPS, lighting) are plugged into a dedicated test circuit; voltage, continuity, and power‑on checks are performed using calibrated meters.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Mechanical components (air‑conditioners, furniture hinges, moving parts) undergo a visual inspection followed by functional trials—e.g., opening/closing drawers, rotating chair wheels, and running motor cycles for 2‑3 minutes.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>All test results are logged in the “Delivery Test Register” and any failures trigger immediate escalation.</span></li>
</ul>

<p><strong>3. Clean Furniture Placement</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
