  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Debris is cleared from aisles and work surfaces within 30 minutes of each uncrating session to maintain a safe, clutter‑free environment.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The housekeeping crew conducts a final walk‑through, confirming that no stray materials remain, and signs the “Clean‑Up Completion Log.”</span></li>
